#. module: atmta_procurement_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:atmta_procurement_request.field_realestate_material_request_rfq__suggested_vendor_ids
msgid ""
"Vendors already listed against the requested products. A suggestion is not a"
" shortlist and a shortlist is not an award."
msgstr ""
"الموردون المدرجون مسبقًا للمنتجات المطلوبة. الاقتراح ليس قائمة مختصرة، "
"والقائمة المختصرة ليست ترسية."

#. module: atmta_procurement_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:atmta_procurement_request.field_realestate_material_request__website_message_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:atmta_procurement_request.field_realestate_procurement_plan__website_message_ids
